        "text": "This book belongs to:\r\n\r\nPublished by\r\n\r\nCentral Narcotics Bureau\r\n\r\n393 New Bridge Road, Singapore 088763\r\n\r\nAll rights reserved.\r\n\r\nPrinted in Singapore, 2019.\r\n\r\nISBN 978-981-14-4715-0\r\n\r\nCAPTAIN DRUG BUSTER\r\n\r\nCAPTAIN DRUG BUSTER\r\n\r\nCAPTAIN DRUG BUSTER\r\n\r\nOrigin\r\nP\r\n\r\nDear Parents\r\n\r\nYou are your child's frst teacher and role model. This activity \r\nbook serves as a resource for you to guide your child towards \r\nembracing a drug-free lifestyle from young. Education can \r\nprevent drug abuse. Let's raise our next generation to be \r\ndrug-free, and keep Singapore drug-free together!\r\n\r\nIllustrated by Woo Seik Yee\r\n\r\n\u001f\u001e\u001d\u001c\u001b\u001a\u0019\u0018\u0017\u0016\u0019\u0015\u0015\u0014\u0017\r\n\r\nFollow us on our social media handles to be updated on our events/activities.\r\n\r\n*Side Activity:\r\nGuide your child to fnd all the hidden \r\nanti-drug ribbons in this book.\r\n\r\nThe anti-drug ribbon, which is a green ribbon over a white one, \r\nrepresents support for the anti-drug cause. \r\n\r\nCAPTAIN DRUG BUSTER\r\n\r\nAsal\r\n\r\nThis is Dan. He is a kind and friendly boy.\r\n\r\nIni ialah Dan. Dia seorang budak yang baik dan mesra.\r\n\r\nAlthough Dan is a bright child, he may also fail at times. ",
