        "text": "Dan has a secret. When he puts on the anti-drug ribbon, he transforms \r\ninto Captain Drug Buster to keep the world safe from drugs!\r\n\r\nDan mempunyai satu rahsia. Apabila dia memakai riben anti-dadah,\r\ndia akan bertukar menjadi Captain Drug Buster untuk melindungi\r\ndunia dari dadah!\r\n\r\nz\r\n\r\n?\r\n\r\nSlowly but surely, Wayne starts to sufer from the harmful \r\nefects of the pills.\r\nWayne has a secret. When he puts on his cloak, he transforms \r\ninto the evil Dr. Wacko!\r\n\r\n",
